      "shortDescription": "TSA Bologna designs and manufactures pneumatic motors, pneumatic gearmotors, torque-reaction arms and equipment for industrial assembly. Its official range includes vane and piston air motors, worm and planetary gearmotor configurations, articulated and telescopic arms and pneumatic accessories.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Tecnologie Speciali Applicate S.r.l., trading as TSA Bologna, is an Italian manufacturer founded in 1984 and based in Zola Predosa near Bologna. The company develops pneumatic drive equipment, torque-reaction arms, assembly systems and special-purpose equipment, with an in-house technical office supporting application-specific configurations.",
        "The official product programme includes modular vane air motors, radial-piston air motors, compact piston motors, pneumatic gearmotors with worm or planetary gearing, articulated reaction arms and telescopic reaction arms. Supporting equipment includes air-treatment units, manual or pneumatic control valves, silencers, brakes and arm accessories. TSA documentation identifies applications such as fastening and assembly, mixers, conveyors, pumps, fans, winches and other machinery requiring pneumatic rotary power or controlled torque reaction."
      ],
